{"id":"n55470-1-11","stage":3,"title":"명함 · 名片","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55470-1-11-1","ko":"처음 뵙겠습니다. 영업부의 김지수라고 합니다.","zh":"初次见面，我是销售部的金智秀。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"처음","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次。","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}},{"text":"뵙겠습니다.","meaning":"拜见","explanation":"뵙다：拜见；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"뵙다","audio":"/audio/3c13f85c4383e3b7b8c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62815","senseId":"1","lemma":"뵙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뵙겠습니다","audio":"/audio/5e389adbc770413db821.mp3"}},{"text":"영업부의","meaning":"销售部、营业部","explanation":"영업부：销售部、营业部；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"영업부","audio":"/audio/963b49f66501f77311e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:영업부:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"영업부","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영업부의","audio":"/audio/68f47894480d46f7d65f.mp3"}},{"text":"김지수라고","meaning":"金智秀","explanation":"김지수：金智秀；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"김지수라고","audio":"/audio/95c2e8c925c03778537f.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김지수라고","audio":"/audio/95c2e8c925c03778537f.mp3"}},{"text":"합니다.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"합니다","audio":"/audio/ba3bd059cedb445814a5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"3c13f85c4383e3b7","term":"뵙다","zh":"拜见","audio"